    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"**New User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for someone new.\\n\\n1. In **Predict** and **Using**, choose the label and only the Tree 2 features from **Tree 1 vs. Tree 2** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Train model**.\\n\\nYou are done when your tree shows. Go to the **Testing** tab.\",\r\n  \"results\": \"**New User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for someone new.\\n\\n> Coach Brooks's team is winning. It is 1st down, and they need a long way to go for a new first down (Yards to Go is Long). Coach Brooks wants to know: will the team run or pass?\\n\\n1. In **Make a Prediction**, choose a category for each feature that fits this user. Write the categories you chose in **New User** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Predict**. Wait until the path stops moving. Write the prediction.\\n3. Compare the prediction to what this user needs. Write ✓ if it fits or ✗ if it doesn't.\\n\\nYou are done when New User in your guide is full.\"\r\n}",
